      "title": "Artemis Electricals and Projects Limited Announces Board and Committee Changes, Effective February 3, 2026",
      "body": "Artemis Electricals and Projects Limited announced that Mr. Deepak Kumar (Non-Executive Non-Independent Director) has been re-designated as Chairperson of the Company in place of Krishnakumar Laxman Bangera (Non-Executive Independent Director), who has ceased to be a Director of the Company. The Board of Directors, based on recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, appointed Mr. Deepak Kumar as Chairperson of the Company in place of Krishnakumar Laxman Bangera, who has ceased to be a Director. In view of the above changes in Board of Directors of the Company, the Board has also reconstituted the following committees with effect from February 3, 2026: Audit Committee, Nomination and Remuneration Committee, Stakeholders Relationship Committee, and Corporate Social Responsi",
