      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.03 (vs ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.03 (down from ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹43.1m (down 77% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹8.37m (down 68% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 19% (up from 14% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 36% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
